{"id": 21029, "title": "A Letter — Language Class", "level": "Intermediate", "hsk_tags": ["HSK3"], "slug": "a-letter-language-class", "audio_url": "/audio/mandarin/21029_a-letter-language-class.mp3", "simplified_paragraphs": ["亲爱的王贝：", "好久不见！ 你最近怎么样？", "这个春天我很忙， 除了工作以外， 还要上汉语课。 我们的汉语课有点儿难， 因为这个汉语老师只说汉语， 不说英语。 开始我们以为她不会说英语， 后来发现她的英语非常好， 但是她不说。 不过， 上了两个月的汉语课， 我发现我的汉语进步得非常快， 尤其是听力和口语。 现在我开始喜欢这个汉语老师了， 因为她， 我们不得不每天练习汉语。", "听说你开始学法语了， 你的法语怎么样了？ 老师教得好吗？ 你有多少个同学？ 你们有法语作业吗？ 一个星期上几节课？ 贵不贵？ 我的问题太多了， 请别笑我。 期待你的回信！", "祝", "一切顺利！", "你的朋友，", "林达", "2025 年6 月30 日"], "traditional_paragraphs": ["親愛的王貝：", "好久不見！ 你最近怎麼樣？", "這個春天我很忙， 除了工作以外， 還要上漢語課。 我們的漢語課有點兒難， 因為這個漢語老師只說漢語， 不說英語。 開始我們以為她不會說英語， 後來發現她的英語非常好， 但是她不說。 不過， 上了兩個月的漢語課， 我發現我的漢語進步得非常快， 尤其是聽力和口語。 現在我開始喜歡這個漢語老師了， 因為她， 我們不得不每天練習漢語。", "聽說你開始學法語了， 你的法語怎麼樣了？ 老師教得好嗎？ 你有多少個同學？ 你們有法語作業嗎？ 一個星期上幾節課？ 貴不貴？ 我的問題太多了， 請別笑我。 期待你的回信！", "祝", "一切順利！", "你的朋友，", "林達", "2025 年6 月30 日"], "pinyin_paragraphs": ["qīn ài de Wáng Bèi：", "hǎo jiǔ bu jiàn！  nǐ zuì jìn zěn me yàng？", "zhè gè chūn tiān wǒ hěn máng，  chú le gōng zuò yǐ wài，  hái yào shàng Hàn yǔ kè。  wǒ men de Hàn yǔ kè yǒu diǎn r nán，  yīn wèi zhè gè Hàn yǔ lǎo shī zhǐ shuō Hàn yǔ，  bù shuō Yīng yǔ。  kāi shǐ wǒ men yǐ wéi tā bù huì shuō Yīng yǔ，  hòu lái fā xiàn tā de Yīng yǔ fēi cháng hǎo，  dàn shì tā bù shuō。  bù guò，  shàng le liǎng gè yuè de Hàn yǔ kè，  wǒ fā xiàn wǒ de Hàn yǔ jìn bù de fēi cháng kuài，  yóu qí shì tīng lì hé kǒu yǔ。  xiàn zài wǒ kāi shǐ xǐ huan zhè gè Hàn yǔ lǎo shī le，  yīn wèi tā，  wǒ men bù dé bù měi tiān liàn xí Hàn yǔ。", "tīng shuō nǐ kāi shǐ xué Fǎ yǔ le，  nǐ de Fǎ yǔ zěn me yàng le？  lǎo shī jiāo de hǎo ma？  nǐ yǒu duō shao gè tóng xué？  nǐ men yǒu Fǎ yǔ zuò yè ma？  yī gè xīng qī shàng jǐ jié kè？  guì bù guì？  wǒ de wèn tí tài duō le，  qǐng bié xiào wǒ。  qī dài nǐ de huí xìn！", "zhù", "yī qiè shùn lì！", "nǐ de péng you，", "Lín Dá", "2025  nián 6  yuè 30  rì"], "english_paragraphs": ["Dear Wang Bei:", "haven't seen you for a long time! how have you been?", "I am very busy this spring. In addition to work, I also have to take Chinese classes. Our Chinese class is a bit difficult because the Chinese teacher only speaks Chinese and not English. At first we thought she didn't speak English, but later we found out that her English was very good, but she didn't speak it. However, after taking Chinese classes for two months, I found that my Chinese has improved very quickly, especially listening and speaking. Now I start to like this Chinese teacher. Because of her, we have to practice Chinese every day.", "", "", "all the best!", "your friend,", "Linda", "June 30, 2025"], "english_full": "Dear Wang Bei:\n\nhaven't seen you for a long time! how have you been?\n\nI am very busy this spring. In addition to work, I also have to take Chinese classes. Our Chinese class is a bit difficult because the Chinese teacher only speaks Chinese and not English. At first we thought she didn't speak English, but later we found out that her English was very good, but she didn't speak it. However, after taking Chinese classes for two months, I found that my Chinese has improved very quickly, especially listening and speaking. Now I start to like this Chinese teacher. Because of her, we have to practice Chinese every day.\n\n\n\n\n\nall the best!\n\nyour friend,\n\nLinda\n\nJune 30, 2025", "ruby_paragraphs": ["<ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"qīn ài de\" data-defn=\"dear; beloved; darling; a polite or affectionate way to address someone\" data-hsk=\"\"><span class=\"si\">亲爱的</span><span class=\"tr\">親愛的</span><rt>qīn ài de</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"Wáng Bèi\" data-defn=\"a personal name, Wang Bei\" data-hsk=\"\"><span class=\"si\">王贝</span><span class=\"tr\">王貝</span><rt>Wáng Bèi</rt></ruby>：", "<ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"hǎo jiǔ bu jiàn\" data-defn=\"long time no see\" data-hsk=\"\"><span class=\"si\">好久不见</span><span class=\"tr\">好久不見</span><rt>hǎo jiǔ bu jiàn</rt></ruby>！ <ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"nǐ\" data-defn=\"you\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">你</span><span class=\"tr\">你</span><rt>nǐ</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"zuì jìn\" data-defn=\"recently\" data-hsk=\"HSK 3\"><span class=\"si\">最近</span><span class=\"tr\">最近</span><rt>zuì jìn</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"zěn me yàng\" data-defn=\"how? / how about? / how was it? / how are things?\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">怎么样</span><span class=\"tr\">怎麼樣</span><rt>zěn me yàng</rt></ruby>？", "<ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"zhè\" data-defn=\"this; these\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">这</span><span class=\"tr\">這</span><rt>zhè</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"gè\" data-defn=\"classifier for people or objects in general\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">个</span><span class=\"tr\">個</span><rt>gè</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"chūn tiān\" data-defn=\"spring (season)\" data-hsk=\"HSK 3\"><span class=\"si\">春天</span><span class=\"tr\">春天</span><rt>chūn tiān</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"wǒ\" data-defn=\"I; me; my\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">我</span><span class=\"tr\">我</span><rt>wǒ</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"hěn\" data-defn=\"very; quite\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">很</span><span class=\"tr\">很</span><rt>hěn</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"máng\" data-defn=\"busy\" data-hsk=\"HSK 2\"><span class=\"si\">忙</span><span class=\"tr\">忙</span><rt>máng</rt></ruby>， <ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"chú le\" data-defn=\"apart from; besides; in addition to\" data-hsk=\"HSK 3\"><span class=\"si\">除了</span><span class=\"tr\">除了</span><rt>chú le</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"gōng zuò\" data-defn=\"job / work / task\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">工作</span><span class=\"tr\">工作</span><rt>gōng zuò</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"yǐ wài\" data-defn=\"apart from / other than / except for\" data-hsk=\"HSK 3\"><span c